---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<Layout title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
    <div class="text">
        I'm a software developer (of ten years), book-lover (since birth) and
        novelist (to the dismay of my readers).
    </div>
    <div>
        This site is an attempt to give myself the creative freedom to write
        about what I enjoy and to hopefully share my passions with others. These
        writings are not to be taken too seriously. I often use them as a way to
        help myself think more deeply about a topic or to crystallise knowledge
        regarding something I'm trying to learn. They suffer from the same
        ailments as all past knowledge does: they're a snapshot of one point of
        view, at one point of time and often from one person who has grown and
        learned since.
    </div>
    <div>
        Most of my blogs are very tech-focused as developing and coding is one
        of my main joys in life. If it's yours as well I hope you'll find
        something interesting in my blogs -- or at the very least I hope you can
        find something to wave your fist at. Feel free to reach out to me on
        LinkedIn or Github regarding any discussion here.
    </div>
    <div>And most all, enjoy reading.</div>
</Layout>
